# 低频词汇 List05
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023恋练有词
# 描述: 低频词汇List05核心词汇

{{bypass}}{/ˈbaɪpɑːs/}{绕过；旁路}{The new road bypasses the town center.}}
{{cabin}}{/ˈkæbɪn/}{小屋；机舱}{They spent the weekend in a cabin in the mountains.}}
{{cable}}{/ˈkeɪbl/}{电缆；有线电视}{The company laid undersea cables for internet connectivity.}}
{{cafeteria}}{/ˌkæfəˈtɪəriə/}{自助餐厅}{The university cafeteria offers a variety of meals.}}
{{calculate}}{/ˈkælkjuleɪt/}{计算；估计}{Scientists calculated the distance to the nearest star.}}
{{calm}}{/kɑːm/}{平静的；使镇定}{She took a deep breath to calm her nerves.}}
{{campus}}{/ˈkæmpəs/}{校园；大学}{The university campus is beautiful in autumn.}}
{{cancel}}{/ˈkænsl/}{取消；撤销}{The flight was cancelled due to bad weather.}}
{{cancer}}{/ˈkænsər/}{癌症；巨蟹座}{Early detection is key to treating cancer effectively.}}
{{candidate}}{/ˈkændɪdət/}{候选人；考生}{The candidate impressed the panel during the interview.}}
{{capable}}{/ˈkeɪpəbl/}{有能力的}{This software is capable of handling large datasets.}}
{{cape}}{/keɪp/}{披风；海角}{The lighthouse stands at the cape overlooking the sea.}}
{{capital}}{/ˈkæpɪtl/}{资本；首都}{The company raised capital through stock offerings.}}
{{captain}}{/ˈkæptɪn/}{船长；队长}{The captain guided the ship safely through the storm.}}
{{caption}}{/ˈkæpʃn/}{标题；字幕}{Each photo has a descriptive caption underneath.}}
{{carbon}}{/ˈkɑːbən/}{碳；复写纸}{Reducing carbon emissions is essential for fighting climate change.}}
{{cargo}}{/ˈkɑːɡəʊ/}{货物；船货}{The ship was loaded with cargo destined for Asia.}}
{{carpenter}}{/ˈkɑːpɪntər/}{木匠；木工}{The carpenter built custom shelves for the library.}}
{{carriage}}{/ˈkærɪdʒ/}{马车；车厢}{The horse-drawn carriage was a popular tourist attraction.}}
{{cartoon}}{/kɑːˈtuːn/}{卡通；漫画}{Children love watching cartoons on Saturday mornings.}}
{{carve}}{/kɑːv/}{雕刻；切割}{The artist carved a beautiful statue out of marble.}}
{{cash}}{/kæʃ/}{现金；兑现}{The store only accepts cash for small purchases.}}
{{casualty}}{/ˈkæʒuəlti/}{伤亡人员}{The earthquake caused several casualties.}}
{{catalog}}{/ˈkætəlɒɡ/}{目录；产品手册}{The library catalog is available online.}}
{{catastrophe}}{/kəˈtæstrəfi/}{灾难；大祸}{The oil spill was an environmental catastrophe.}}
{{cease}}{/siːs/}{停止；终止}{The factory ceased operations due to financial difficulties.}}
{{census}}{/ˈsensəs/}{人口普查}{The census is conducted every ten years.}}
{{ceramic}}{/sɪˈræmɪk/}{陶瓷的；陶瓷制品}{The vase is made of high-quality ceramic.}}
{{certify}}{/ˈsɜːtɪfaɪ/}{证明；认证}{The document was certified by a notary public.}}
{{chamber}}{/ˈtʃeɪmbər/}{房间；议院}{The senator addressed the upper chamber of parliament.}}
